{"id":"bedu_rfnis","lemma":"Bedürfnis","pos":"noun","rank":4183,"glosses":["desire, urge","need, necessity"],"ipa":"/bəˈdʏʁfnɪs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/De-Bed%C3%BCrfnis.ogg/De-Bed%C3%BCrfnis.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Bedürfnisses","plural":"Bedürfnisse"},"examples":[{"text":"Er kann seine Bedürfnisse nicht kontrollieren.","en":"He can't control his desires.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to check"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte das Bedürfnis, etwas zu tun.","en":"I felt the need to do something.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"something"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Ich habe wirklich das Bedürfnis, jemanden zu schlagen.","en":"I really need to hit somebody.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/229","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"someone, somebody","l":"jemand"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to beat"}]},{"text":"Das Buch ist geeignet für deine Bedürfnisse.","en":"This book is suitable for your needs.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"suitable, appropriate"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Alle unsere Bedürfnisse sind befriedigt.","en":"All our demands have been met.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"to satisfy","l":"befriedigen"}]}]}